    <h1 class="bd-title">Empowering an eCommerce Marketplace with Real-Time Pricing Intelligence</h1>
    <p class="bd-exc">A fast-growing Southeast Asian eCommerce marketplace used Dataseeders' real-time pricing intelligence to win 23% more Buy Box placements and cut pricing errors by 85%.</p>
    <div class="bd-meta"><span>Client: <strong>Multi-Category eCommerce Platform</strong></span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="bd-hero" style="background-image:url('../images/ecommerce_under700kb.jpg');"></div>
