  <section class="sec-overview">
    <div class="ov-quote">
      <span class="ov-mark">&#8220;</span>
      <p class="ov-lead">Transform your physical and omnichannel retail operations with data driven insights covering
        pricing, promotions, inventory, customer behavior, and shelf compliance across stores and channels.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ov-content">
      <h3 class="ov-h2">How Retailers Are Using Data to Win in a Competitive Market</h3>
      <p class="ov-p">Retail has become an omnichannel reality. Customers expect seamless experiences whether they shop
        in store, online, or through a mobile app. Yet most retailers still operate with disconnected data silos. Store
        level decisions are made without online intelligence. E commerce teams ignore in store pricing gaps. Supply
        chain plans miss real demand signals from the checkout counter. We help retailers collect, structure, and
        analyze data from every touchpoint including point of sale systems, loyalty programs, store footfall counters,
        shelf sensors, competitor store audits, e commerce platforms, and marketplace listings.</p>
      <p class="ov-p">Our retail data solutions cover the full retail ecosystem. We track in store and online pricing
        compliance to protect margins across channels. We monitor promotions at shelf level and digital circulars to
        measure true effectiveness. We collect customer insights from transaction data, feedback forms, and social
        listening to understand what drives loyalty. We provide inventory and supply chain intelligence to prevent
        stockouts and optimize replenishment. We deliver omnichannel visibility so you know how online browsing converts
        to in store purchases. We analyze market trends and consumer behavior including footfall patterns, dwell time,
        and basket composition by store format. We monitor nutritional and compliance data to meet regulatory standards
        on every shelf. We power digital shelf and planogram analytics to ensure planograms are executed correctly
        across hundreds of stores. We conduct competitor and market research through systematic store checks and price
        audits. And we track logistics and delivery intelligence for click and collect, ship from store, and same day
        delivery models.</p>
      <p class="ov-p">We build custom retail intelligence pipelines based on your store footprint, product categories,
        competitor set, geographic coverage, and refresh frequency from daily to weekly. Delivery options include
        interactive dashboards, automated store audit reports, shelf compliance heatmaps, and API feeds into your retail
        execution or category management systems. With our data, retailers reduce pricing discrepancies across channels,
        improve shelf availability, increase promotion ROI, and make store level decisions backed by real intelligence.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="sec-wws">
    <div class="wws-shell">
      <aside class="wws-toc">
