      <article class="bd-article">
        <h2>Client Overview</h2>
        <p>Our client is an emerging real estate aggregator platform targeting to disrupt the property search experience
          across metro and tier-2 cities. Their platform lists residential, commercial, and rental properties
          accumulated from various listing sites, realtors, and property developers. The client's longstanding vision
          was to become a one-stop platform for buyers, renters, agents, and real estate firms looking for data-backed
          property discovery.</p>
        <h2>Client Requirements</h2>
        <p>To grow in a competitive sector and attract both users and real estate partners, the client required:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Real time property listing data from various portals and agency websites.</li>
        </ul>
        <ul>
          <li>Property market insights to track pricing trends, location demand, property inventory fluctuations, and
            more.</li>
        </ul>
        <ul>
          <li>Effective promotion of better deals to entice new customers and investors with dynamic pricing visibility.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <ul>
          <li>Appeal realtors and property agents to register exclusively on their platform.</li>
        </ul>
        <ul>
          <li>Competitor benchmarking to assess how their listings and offers perform in compare to major competitors.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Challenges</h2>
        <p>Despite a capable platform and having a strong backend, the client met several hurdles:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Inconsistent data across hundreds of sources made aggregation difficult.</li>
        </ul>
        <ul>
          <li>Manual curation of listings delayed the time-to-market for new deals.</li>
        </ul>
        <ul>
          <li>Low listing quality and outdated property information affected user trust.</li>
        </ul>
        <ul>
          <li>Poor distinction from established platforms reduced the appeal for realtors and brokers.</li>
        </ul>
        <ul>
          <li>Inadequate market insights disallowed smart promotion of properties based on real-time demand or pricing
            trends.</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Techdataseeders Solutions</h2>
        <p>Techdataseeders arranged a tailored data scraping and analytics solution to meet the client's strategic and
          operational goals.</p>
        <h3>Real-Time Property Listing Scraping</h3>
        <p>Scraped data from top real estate portals, broker sites, and developer platforms to keep listings fresh and
          competitive.</p>
        <h3>Property Attribute Structuring</h3>
        <p>Extracted structured data such as pricing, size, location, amenities, furnishing, and ownership details.</p>
        <h3>Competitive Deal Analytics</h3>
        <p>Provided evaluation reports of similar listings by location, type, and price that helping the client creating
          and offer better deals.</p>
        <h3>Agent and Realtor Database</h3>
        <p>Collected verified contact information of local brokers and realtors to help the client expand their network.
        </p>
        <h3>Market Trends Dashboard</h3>
        <p>Built a dashboard showcasing rental yields, pricing patterns, and hot localities to assist in strategic
          decision-making.</p>
        <h3>Automated Feed Integration</h3>
        <p>Delivered clean datasets weekly via APIs compatible with their CMS for seamless publishing and analytics.</p>
        <h2>Benefits to the Client</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>75% upsurge in active property listings, covering 100+ cities and 300+ micro markets.</li>
        </ul>
        <ul>
          <li>Reduced listing onboarding time by 70% with automated data feeds.</li>
        </ul>
        <ul>
          <li>25% growth in organic traffic due to improved deal listings and SEO optimized property pages.</li>
        </ul>
        <ul>
          <li>310+ new realtor and broker partnerships established through improved agent outreach data.</li>
        </ul>
        <ul>
          <li>Improved platform stickiness with real-time pricing trends and intelligent sorting.</li>
        </ul>
        <ul>
          <li>Increased conversions by 21% with augmented deal visibility and competitive property recommendations.</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Conclusion</h2>
        <p>Techdataseeders empowered the client to transform into a data enabled real estate platform, not just common
          listing aggregator. With real-time property data, competitive intelligence, and agent procurement support,
          they carved out a different presence in a highly competitive sector by offering value to both end-users and
          real estate professionals.</p>
