  <section class="sec-overview">
    <div class="ov-quote">
      <span class="ov-mark">&#8220;</span>
      <p class="ov-lead">Transform your retail operations with data-driven insights covering product trends, customer
        behavior, pricing dynamics, and assortment optimization across online and offline channels.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ov-content">
      <h3 class="ov-h2">How Retailers Are Using Data to Win in a Competitive Market</h3>
      <p class="ov-p">Retail and e-commerce businesses generate massive amounts of data from transactions, browsing
        behavior, inventory systems, and competitor platforms. However, raw data alone doesn't drive growth   actionable
        intelligence does. We help retailers collect, normalize, and analyze structured data from marketplaces (Amazon,
        Walmart, Flipkart), D2C websites, and omnichannel sources to uncover hidden opportunities.</p>
      <p class="ov-p">Our retail data solutions include real-time price monitoring, stockout detection, promotional
        effectiveness tracking, and catalog enrichment. For example, we can alert you when a competitor changes pricing
        on a high-volume SKU, or when a specific product category shows sudden demand spikes. Using AI-powered
        analytics, we identify optimal pricing windows, seasonal assortment gaps, and underperforming product listings
        that need attention.</p>
      <p class="ov-p">We build custom retail intelligence pipelines based on your product catalog, priority competitors,
        target geographies, and refresh frequencies. Delivery options include automated dashboards, scheduled reports,
        and API feeds that plug directly into your existing pricing engine or ERP system. With our data, retailers
        reduce manual competitor checks by 90%, improve margin management, and respond to market changes in hours   not
        weeks.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="sec-wws">
    <div class="wws-shell">
